SharedARMain [Scene Root]
│
├── OVRCameraRig                      ← drag from Meta XR Core SDK samples
│   ├── TrackingSpace                 ← TAG THIS: "TrackingSpace"
│   │   ├── LeftHandAnchor
│   │   ├── RightHandAnchor
│   │   └── CenterEyeAnchor
│   ├── OVRPassthroughLayer           ← add component
│   └── PassthroughController.cs     ← add component
│
├── OVRManager                        ← drag from prefabs, enable Insight Passthrough
│
├── _AnchorSystem
│   └── SharedAnchorManager.cs       ← assign ovrCameraRigTrackingSpace in Inspector
│
├── _Spawner
│   ├── SharedObjectSpawner.cs
│   └── SpawnTrigger.cs
│
├── DebugCanvas [World Space]
│   └── DebugStatusUI.cs
│
└── Lighting
    └── Directional Light            ← keep dim; passthrough provides real-world light
